{"id":"spuren","lemma":"spuren","pos":"verb","rank":1363,"glosses":["to leave a trace"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/64/De-spuren.ogg/De-spuren.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Im Schnee sind frische Spuren.","en":"There are fresh tracks in the snow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/718190","words":[{"g":"in the"},{"g":"snow"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"freshly","l":"frisch"},null]},{"text":"Du hättest deine Spuren verwischen sollen.","en":"You should've covered your tracks.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"to smudge, to smear"},{"g":"should"}]},{"text":"Sie hätten Ihre Spuren verwischen sollen.","en":"You should've covered your tracks.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"to smudge, to smear"},{"g":"should"}]},{"text":"Frische Spuren sind im Schnee.","en":"There are fresh tracks in the snow.","words":[{"g":"freshly","l":"frisch"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"snow"}]},{"text":"Der harte Winter hat seine Spuren hinterlassen.","en":"The harsh winter left its mark.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"hard","l":"hart"},{"g":"winter"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"to leave"}]}]}